   "text": "Legend\npurple \u2014 consuming Uplink services (pip)\nblue \u2014 internal library layers (imports point down)\nyellow \u2014 migrations + seeds\ngreen \u2014 shared PostgreSQL database\nred \u2014 external systems / runners\nNot used here: Redis, HTTP server,\nAUTH_URL / CRM_URL (belong to consumers)",
